===Verb===
{{en-verb|keep<,,kept> the wolf from the door}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[ward off]] [[poverty]] or [[hunger]].
#: {{ux|en|They didn't earn much, but it was enough to '''keep the wolf from the door'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Howell Epistolae|chapter=LX. To Tho. Young, Esq|date=28 April 1645|section=VI|page=284|passage=Indeed 'tis very fitting that ''He'' or ''She'' ſhould have wherewith to ſupport both, according to their quality, at leaſt to '''keep the Wolf from the Door''', otherwiſe 'twere a meer madneſs to Marry; {{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic|humorous|euphemism}} To delay [[sexual]] [[ejaculation]].
#* {{quote-av|en|actor={{w|Steve Coogan}}|role={{w|Alan Partridge}}|writer={{w|Peter Baynham}}, Steve Coogan, and {{w|Armando Iannucci}}|title=[[w:I'm Alan Partridge|I'm Alan Partridge]]|episode=Alan Attraction|year=1997|passage=Do you mind if I talk? It helps me '''keep the wolf from the door''', so to speak. Jill, what do you think of the pedestrianization of Norwich city centre?}}
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|author=“the mekon”|title=Wanking|url=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/uk.media.dvd/lyvRHbq_LeU/Kty8oZaPNnUJ|newsgroup=uk.media.dvd|id=ai45tt$110mqu$2@ID-115312.news.dfncis.de|date=30 July 2002|passage=I find it useful to look at a picture of {{w|Mo Mowlam}} at the change hands point, it helps to ‘'''keep the wolf from the door'''’ so to speak.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Carnal Calendar|url=http://www.mh.co.za/sex-women/carnal-calendar/|archiveurl=http://web.archive.org/web/20170308175425/http://www.mh.co.za/sex-women/carnal-calendar/|archivedate=8 March 2017|magazine={{w|Men's Health}}|location=South Africa|date=1 December 2014|passage=If you haven't got the self-control to '''keep the wolf from the door''' yourself, ask your partner to help out. She'll enjoy being the one in the driving seat for a change.}}

